        }
      ],
      "message": "BIP95: Change proposed Testnet 5 genesis block structure\n\nThis moves the anti-pre-mine commitment back into `pszTimestamp` and\nkeeps it as ASCII text, rather than using it as a fake public key. The\ngenesis transaction's output is replaced by an `OP_RETURN` to avoid\nconfusion over spendability. Using the `OP_RETURN` output and `nVersion`\nrolling for additional nonce bits are explicitly allowed.",
